lted after us-east: orchestrator error", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 8616, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01BkZhcmwgrSh4WwTXwoYRLD", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 10725, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_011TG9ytJJV4JZdrZT5xVd8E", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 11025, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_011TG9ytJJV4JZdrZT5xVd8E", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 11025, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011TG9ytJJV4JZdrZT5xVd8E", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 14711, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01SDpKmadYwWwoNHdsmA1cbT", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 18711, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01SDpKmadYwWwoNHdsmA1cbT", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 18711, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01SDpKmadYwWwoNHdsmA1cbT", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 20619, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01BQfTpbgD4Dkb6iSkZTRbxg", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 20919, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01BQfTpbgD4Dkb6iSkZTRbxg", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20919, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01BQfTpbgD4Dkb6iSkZTRbxg", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 20919, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01KA9a4pmjHLJmRear6W5HHY", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 21219, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01KA9a4pmjHLJmRear6W5HHY", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 21219, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01KA9a4pmjHLJmRear6W5HHY", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 26586, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01MQxtx99meA8vp35sCb8Zxr", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest production deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), error rate 18%. It was rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east with an orchestrator error, which left versions mixed across regions (us-east v2.3.0, us-west/eu-west v2.3.1). A second rollback attempt completed. All three regions now run v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and error rate is 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure (its v2.3.1-rc build was also unhealthy in staging) and look into the orchestrator error during rollout.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57186, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01MQxtx99meA8vp35sCb8Zxr", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57186, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MQxtx99meA8vp35sCb8Zxr", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 58726, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0184vRSEX1kmaXufeztgGsN1", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 59026, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0184vRSEX1kmaXufeztgGsN1", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 59026, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0184vRSEX1kmaXufeztgGsN1", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 64329, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback**\n- **Before:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It was failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- **Target:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. It had been healthy there before, so no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **First attempt:** it stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error. That left us-east on v2.3.0 while us-west and eu-west were still on v2.3.1. I checked the status and then ran the same rollback again, which finished.\n- **Now:** all three regions run v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is 0.2%.\n\n**Incident INC-0001 (SEV2)**\n- The request to create it timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had gone through, so there's only one incident and the on-call engineer was paged once.\n- It covers the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and the retry) and the current state. It also lists two follow-ups: finding why v2.3.1 failed, and looking into the orchestrator error.\n\nThe earlier test build of v2.3.1 (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy in staging, so it shouldn't have been promoted. It's worth asking why that check didn't stop the release.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01T9i5LosqTn2Rit2DQ5rRpu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01RcyscZ91mtZcuVi2PM6ELv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01BkZhcmwgrSh4WwTXwoYRLD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_011TG9ytJJV4JZdrZT5xVd8E", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version again should be safe to repeat, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01SDpKmadYwWwoNHdsmA1cbT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01BQfTpbgD4Dkb6iSkZTRbxg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01KA9a4pmjHLJmRear6W5HHY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01MQxtx99meA8vp35sCb8Zxr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest production deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), error rate 18%. It was rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east with an orchestrator error, which left versions mixed across regions (us-east v2.3.0, us-west/eu-west v2.3.1). A second rollback attempt completed. All three regions now run v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and error rate is 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure (its v2.3.1-rc build was also unhealthy in staging) and look into the orchestrator error during rollout.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_0184vRSEX1kmaXufeztgGsN1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback**\n- **Before:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It was failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- **Target:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. It had been healthy there before, so no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **First attempt:** it stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error. That left us-east on v2.3.0 while us-west and eu-west were still on v2.3.1. I checked the status and then ran the same rollback again, which finished.\n- **Now:** all three regions run v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is 0.2%.\n\n**Incident INC-0001 (SEV2)**\n- The request to create it timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had gone through, so there's only one incident and the on-call engineer was paged once.\n- It covers the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and the retry) and the current state. It also lists two follow-ups: finding why v2.3.1 failed, and looking into the orchestrator error.\n\nThe earlier test build of v2.3.1 (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy in staging, so it shouldn't have been promoted. It's worth asking why that check didn't stop the release.", "type": "text"}]}]}